    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your stand inhales a gas, smoke or fog effect in a @Template[burst|distance:10]{10-ft burst} within its reach, like Star Platinum inhaling the fog stand Justice. A spell effect is counteracted if its rank is at most half your level (rounded up). A creature made of gas in the area takes 1d6 bludgeoning per level (@Check[fortitude|against:stand|basic]{basic Fortitude} save against your stand DC), and on a failure it's @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.kWc1fhmv9LBiTuei]{grabbed} by the stand.</p>",
